The invariant assertions in the test file expect:
- `ghost_winner != address(0)` after finish
- `ghost_max_bidder == ghost_winner` (highest cumulative bidder wins)
- `ghost_winner == nft.ownerOf(completedAuctionId)` (winner actually received the NFT)

